our Term of Service.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nMike', 'plain', 'all', 471, 472, '2', '2016-11-23 23:13:44'),
(68, '{FIRSTNAME},  Sorry For The Multiple Emails', 'Hi {FIRSTNAME},\r\n\r\nMike here.  Just a short note to say sorry for sending the multiple emails.\r\nWe had issues with our mailing script and that is the reason you did\r\nnot receive an email on the 20th of November.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nMike', 'plain', 'all', 472, 472, '2', '2016-11-25 08:32:49'),
(69, '{FIRSTNAME}, An IMPORTANT Message From MCBT', 'Hi {FIRSTNAME},\r\n\r\nMike here.  Just a short note to let you know that we are back\r\nonline.  The cash back rate will be 110% and you can start\r\npurchasing units on Monday, the 23rd of Oct.\r\n\r\nThere is only 1 change.  We will charge a 5% admin fee.  This\r\nfee will help cover Payza\\\'s transaction fees and some admin\r\nexpenses.  The 5% admin fee will be taken from your Total Cash\r\nEarned balance at the time of payout.\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nMike\r\n\r\n<a href=\\\"http://www.mycashbacktraffic.com/index.php\\\">MyCashBackTraffic.com</a>', 'plain', 'all', 463, 461, '2', '2017-10-19 15:41:45'),
(70, '{FIRSTNAME}, This is How You Make At Least $900.00 A Week', 'Hi {FIRSTNAME},\r\n\r\nMike here.  Just a short note to let you know about a simple and easy way \r\nto make money from home.  I\\\'m not going to hype this program.  I want \r\nyou to decide for yourself.  The only thing I can tell you is this program is \r\nworking for us.\r\n\r\nIf you would like to make at least $900.00 a week, click on the link below.\r\n<a href=\\\"http://www.postcardmillionaires.com\\\">PostcardMillionaires.com</a> \r\n\r\n\r\nTo Your Success,\r\n\r\nMike\r\n\r\n<a href=\\\"http://www.mycashbacktraffic.com/index.php\\\">MyCashBackTraffic.com</a>', 'plain', 'all', 443, 443, '2', '2017-10-26 09:16:21'),
(71, '{FIRSTNAME}, MCBT is Back Online', 'Hi {FIRSTNAME},\r\n\r\nMike here.  Just a short note to let you know that we are back\r\nonline.  We have made a couple of changes.  Below are the changes\r\nand highlights of the program:\r\n\r\n1)  The cash back rate is 110%.  \r\n\r\n2)  The affiliate commissions rate is 2%.\r\n\r\n3)  Traffic Units will expire in 60 days instead of 30 days.\r\n\r\n4)  The minimum number of Active units needed for pay will be 6\r\ninstead of 3.\r\n\r\n5)  And due to Payza\\\'s high transactions fees, we will deduct a \r\n5% admin fee.  The admin fee will be 5% of your Total Cash Earned\r\nand will be deducted during payouts.  We hope you can join us again!\r\n\r\nSincerely,\r\n\r\nMike\r\n\r\n<a href=\\\"http://www.mycashbacktraffic.com/index.php\\\">MyCashBackTraffic.com</a>', 'plain', 'all', 447, 447, '2', '2018-03-03 01:21:48'),
